
ALIGN 4 
SwarmID_Link: 
WORD SwarmID
FlankID_Link:
WORD FlankID
LunaID_Link:
WORD LunaID 
PaviseID_Link:
WORD PaviseID 
AegisID_Link:
WORD AegisID 
SwarmBonusDamagePercent:
WORD 100
